      "created_at": "2021-02-07T01:22:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Go to the store page where they are salling the core rule book. (Here is the link: https://store.greaterthangames.com/sentinel-comics-the-roleplaying-game-core-rulebook.html#product-details-tab-description)</p>\n<p>On the bottom of the page where it said \" <span>Also includes the Download file!\" <strong>There are four pdf files.</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>I thought that these files came with the book but no. These files are previews for the book. <strong>Click on them and you will download them, you want the last three.</strong></span></p>\n<p>The Creating Heroes Quick Reference in not really helpful without the book. But it did convince me to buy the book instead of waiting for my frends.</p>",
